# Chain Selector

Purpose:
  Map execution type to chain node ID.

Map:
  prompt: P1
  docs: D1
  sdd: S1
  code: C1
  review: R1
  deploy: DEP1
  feature: F1
  bugfix: B1
  hotfix: H1
  refactor: RF1
  security: SEC1
  maintenance: M1
  migration: MG1
  incident: I1

Selector:
  input: type
  output: node_id
   fallback: D0

State: +
